supermox-tmpfiles (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Install /usr/bin/systemd-tmpfiles into the package via
    override_dh_auto_install; previously the shim was never copied into the
    .deb, so postfix's postinst (systemd-tmpfiles: not found, exit 127) failed
    and left postfix, pve-manager and supermox-ve unconfigured.

 -- SuperMox <noreply@supermox.me>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:30:00 -0700

supermox-tmpfiles (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: POSIX sh replacement for systemd-standalone-tmpfiles.
  * Provides: systemd-tmpfiles so debhelper's dh_installtmpfiles dependency
    (pulled in by qemu-server's debian/tmpfiles) is satisfied without
    installing any systemd package.
  * Conflicts: systemd-standalone-tmpfiles to prevent both being installed.

 -- SuperMox <noreply@supermox.me>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:00:00 -0700
